observed = "Store::open allows independent writable handles for one root, each with a full in-memory BTreeMap. persist overwrites the entire store through the fixed store.bin.tmp at line 1153 without locking or a generation check. Two daemon processes or separately opened handles can overwrite each others session, receipt or outbox updates."
